    <p>Welcome to <strong>KFoodHack.com</strong>, your ultimate digital pantry guide to Korean convenience store combinations, ramen customizations, and 5-minute Korean sauces.</p>
    
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>Authentic Korean cooking doesn't have to require 20 unfamiliar ingredients or hours of preparation. We test and curate practical K-food hacks using everyday ingredients you can easily find at Trader Joe's, Costco, Walmart, or your local supermarket.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Tested Ratios:</strong> Every ramen hack and sauce formula is kitchen-tested for balanced heat and maximum umami.</li>
      <li><strong>Smart Substitutes:</strong> We provide accessible grocery swaps for gochujang, doenjang, and Korean pantry staples.</li>
      <li><strong>Clear Nutrition & Prep Data:</strong> Quick prep times, spice ratings, and calorie estimates for busy foodies.</li>
    </ul>

